### FR-007 / Edge Cases - JSON mal formado: 400 SLHD_GENE_00002
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{ "message":

> {%
    client.test("rechaza el JSON ilegible con 400", function () {
